const growthGroups=[['today',[['workspace','overview'],['routine','calendar & standards']]],['clients',[['crm','client journeys'],['forms','discovery studio']]],['delivery',[['work','assignments & review'],['venture','venture operations']]],['finance',[['finance','receipts & targets']]],['people',[['staff','staff performance'],['people','onboarding']]],['library & settings',[['catalogue','service catalogue'],['offers','reusable offers'],['resources-admin','documents & access'],['content','content studio'],['system','system readiness']]]];
const beforeGroupedWorkspace=workspace;
workspace=function(content){let html=beforeGroupedWorkspace(content);let nav=growthGroups.map(([name,items])=>`<div class="navgroup"><span>${name}</span>${items.filter(([p])=>scope==='holding'||!['people','content','finance'].includes(p)).map(([p,t])=>`<a class="${route[0]===p?'active':''}" href="#${p==='venture'&&scope!=='holding'?'venture/'+encodeURIComponent(scope):p}">${t}</a>`).join('')}</div>`).join('');return html.replace(/<nav>[\s\S]*?<\/nav>/,`<nav>${nav}<a href="#home">holding website ↗</a></nav>`)};
function paidWork(l){let ids=new Set(l.activeSelection||l.quote?.services?.map(s=>s.id)||[]);return l.work.filter(w=>ids.size?ids.has(w.serviceId):l.paid)}
function workStatus(w){return ({ready:'ready to begin','waiting for requirements':'waiting for your information','in progress':'work in progress','under review':'quality review',approved:'ready for final delivery',delivered:'completed',blocked:'needs attention','changes requested':'changes in progress'})[w.status]||w.status}
function orderProgress(l){let work=paidWork(l),done=work.filter(w=>w.status==='delivered').length,complete=work.length>0&&done===work.length,missing=l.requirements.filter(r=>!['accepted','submitted'].includes(r.status)&&work.some(w=>w.status!=='delivered'&&(r.workId?r.workId===w.id:r.serviceId?r.serviceId===w.serviceId:r.venture==='holding'||r.venture===w.venture))),next=missing.length?'provide or clarify the outstanding information':complete?'confirm that you received and can use your deliverables':'your delivery team is working on the agreed scope';return flowHeader(l,'progress')+flowTitle('your current order',complete?'your agreed work is complete.':'your work, clearly in view.',`${done} of ${work.length} purchased services completed. your wider roadmap is separate below.`)+`<div class="flow-nextaction"><span>next action / ${missing.length||complete?'you':'hamzury team'}</span><p>${E(next)}</p>${missing.length?button('open my requirements →','client/'+l.id+'/requirements','secondary'):''}</div>${complete?'<div class="flow-badge"><span>✓</span><div><strong>agreed scope completed</strong><p>delivery milestone · confirm receipt below</p></div></div>':''}<section class="flow-deliveries">${work.map(w=>{let files=l.files.filter(f=>f.workId===w.id&&['review','final'].includes(f.release));let danger=['blocked','changes requested'].includes(w.status);return `<article class="flow-delivery"><div class="flow-status ${w.status==='delivered'?'success':danger?'danger':'pending'}">${w.status==='delivered'?'✓':danger?'!':'◷'} ${E(workStatus(w))}</div>${tag(w.venture)}<h3>${E(w.title)}</h3><p class="small">expected delivery: ${w.due?displayDate(w.due):'your team is confirming the schedule'}</p><p>${E(w.evidence||'the team will publish progress and any schedule changes here.')}</p>${files.map(f=>`<button class="secondary" onclick="downloadFile('${f.id}')">${f.release==='final'?'download':'review'} ${E(f.title)}</button>`).join('')}</article>`}).join('')}</section>${complete?`<section class="flow-message"><h2>is everything received and usable?</h2><p>tell us before we recommend more work. any issue stays in this journey.</p>${l.deliveryAcknowledged?'<p class="flow-status success">✓ receipt confirmed</p>':`<button onclick="acknowledgeDelivery('${l.id}')">confirm receipt</button>`}</section>`:''}<section class="flow-message"><h2>updates & support</h2>${l.updates.map(u=>`<div class="statusline"><span class="small">${displayDate(u.at)} · next: ${E(u.next||'team update')}</span><p>${E(u.message)}</p></div>`).join('')||'<p>no update published yet. your team will keep the next action visible.</p>'}<form onsubmit="feedback(event,'${l.id}')"><label>question, feedback or a delivery issue</label><textarea name="message" required></textarea><div class="actions"><button class="secondary">send to the team</button></div></form></section><details class="flow-message"><summary>your full business roadmap</summary><p>purchased work above belongs to your current order. these other recommendations are available for later.</p>${flowItems(l).filter(s=>!work.some(w=>w.serviceId===s.id)).map(s=>`<div class="row"><span>${E(s.title)}</span><small>${choice(l,s.id)==='have'?'already available · subject to team review':'planned for later'}</small></div>`).join('')||'<p>your team will recommend the next appropriate stage when ready.</p>'}${button('review my wider roadmap','client/'+l.id+'/roadmap','secondary')}<div class="actions"><button class="ghost" onclick="downloadJourney('${l.id}','pdf','roadmap')">download full roadmap</button><button class="ghost" onclick="downloadJourney('${l.id}','png','roadmap')">save roadmap image</button></div></details>${l.step1Demo?`<details class="flow-demo-control"><summary>sample experience controls</summary><button class="secondary" onclick="simulateDelivery('${l.id}')">simulate next delivery</button></details>`:''}`+flowEnd(l)}
function acknowledgeDelivery(id){let l=lead(id);l.deliveryAcknowledged=now();event(l,'client confirmed receipt of agreed deliverables');render()}
const beforeGrowthClient=clientView;
clientView=function(){let l=lead(route[1]),p=route[2];if(l?.paid&&(p==='progress'||p==='status'||!p))return orderProgress(l);let html=beforeGrowthClient();if(l&&p==='reference'&&!isPublished(l))html=html.replace('our specialist team will review your situation and prepare a clear recommendation.','our specialist team will review your situation and prepare a clear recommendation. your coordinator will confirm the review time here.').replace('</article>',`</article><div class="flow-nextaction"><span>next / hamzury client desk</span><p>${l.reviewDue?'recommendation expected: '+displayDate(l.reviewDue):'review schedule awaiting confirmation by your coordinator.'}</p><p class="small">need to correct an answer? use the discovery link or contact the desk with your reference.</p></div>`);if(l&&p==='roadmap')html=html.replace('only the work you need.','your wider business roadmap.').replace('add an item, mark it already available, or leave it for later. tap the name for details.','choose the missing essentials at your pace. existing assets are subject to team review. purchased work stays in your current order.');return html};
const beforeGrowthOverview=overview;
overview=function(){if(scope!=='holding')return title('my work today',E(scope)+' / clear priorities.','review deadlines, blockers and client updates before starting the next task.',button('open assignments →','work'))+taskView();return beforeGrowthOverview()};

function clientSupport(l){let issues=(db.escalations||[]).filter(e=>e.clientId===l.id);return `<section class="flow-message"><h2>your support desk</h2><p class="small">hamzury client desk · reference ${E(l.id)}</p>${issues.map(e=>`<article class="statusline"><b>${E(e.status)} · ${E(e.priority||'normal')}</b><p>${E(e.issue||e.summary||'support request')}</p><p class="small">owner: ${E(db.staff.find(s=>s.id===e.owner)?.name||e.owner||'client desk')} · received ${displayDate(e.at||e.created)} · response expected ${displayDate(e.due)}</p>${e.resolution?`<p>${E(e.resolution)}</p>`:''}</article>`).join('')||'<p>no support issues recorded. use the message box above if you need help.</p>'}</section>`}
const cxClient=clientView;
clientView=function(){let l=lead(route[1]);if(!l)return cxClient();let p=route[2];if(p==='proposal'&&isPublished(l)){let v=l.proposalVersion;let draft={understood:v.understood||l.name,priority:v.priority||l.answers?.goal||'review the recommended starting stage',recommendation:v.recommendation||v.text,next:v.next||'review your roadmap and choose what is useful now'};return flowHeader(l,'proposal')+flowTitle('your reviewed recommendation','a clear place to begin.','review the priorities, then choose your starting point.')+`<article class="proposal-preview">${proposalPreviewBody(draft).replace('<span class="previewbutton">open my roadmap →</span>','')}</article><div class="flow-actions">${l.roadmapVersion?button('open my roadmap →','client/'+l.id+'/roadmap'):button('return to my reference','client/'+l.id+'/reference')}</div>`+flowEnd(l)}let html=cxClient();if(p==='progress'&&l.paid)html=html.replace('<footer class="flow-footer">',clientSupport(l)+'<footer class="flow-footer">');if(p==='review')html=html.replace('<div class="flow-actions">',reviewTerms(l)+'<div class="flow-actions">');if(p==='payment')html=html.replace('✓ sample payment verified','✓ payment verified · agreed work activated').replace('◷ awaiting payment verification','◷ awaiting payment submission').replace('<section class="flow-message">',reviewTerms(l)+'<section class="flow-message">');if(p==='requirements'&&l.paid)html=html.replace('</form>',`<button type="submit" class="secondary" name="saveExit" value="yes">save & return later</button><p class="small">saved responses remain in this browser. return using reference ${E(l.id)}.</p></form>`);return html};
function reviewTerms(l){let q=l.quote;return `<section class="flow-message"><h2>before you confirm</h2><p><b>scope & revisions:</b> ${E(q?.terms||'your team will confirm the written scope, included revisions and excluded fees before payment.')}</p><p><b>payment arrangement:</b> ${E(q?.paymentTerms||'full agreed funding before activation; deposits require a separately confirmed funded scope.')}</p><p><b>requirements:</b> ${E(chosen(l).map(s=>s.req).filter(Boolean).join(' · ')||'your service-specific checklist follows activation.')}</p><p><b>delivery basis:</b> the relevant service starts after verified payment and its complete, accepted requirements. dates and external dependencies are confirmed by the team.</p></section>`}
const cxItem=flowItem;
flowItem=function(l,s){let html=cxItem(l,s);if(!l.work.some(w=>w.serviceId===s.id))html=html.replace('</div></div></article>',`<button class="flow-have" aria-pressed="${choice(l,s.id)==='later'}" onclick="requestFlowChoice('${l.id}','${s.id}','later')">later</button></div></div></article>`);return html.replace('✓ already have · undo','✓ available for review · undo')};
const cxReqReview=reviewRequirement;
reviewRequirement=function(id,rid,status){cxReqReview(id,rid,status);let l=lead(id);l.work.forEach(w=>{let relevant=l.requirements.filter(r=>r.workId?r.workId===w.id:r.serviceId?r.serviceId===w.serviceId:r.venture==='holding'||r.venture===w.venture);if(w.status==='waiting for requirements'&&relevant.length&&relevant.every(r=>r.status==='accepted'))w.status='ready'});save();render()};
const cxSubmitRequirement=submitRequirementQuestion;
submitRequirementQuestion=async function(e,id,rid){let leave=e.submitter?.name==='saveExit';await cxSubmitRequirement(e,id,rid);if(leave&&['submitted','not available','later','accepted'].includes(lead(id).requirements.find(r=>r.id===rid).status)){flowGo(lead(id),'progress');toast('your response is saved. you can return to requirements later.')}};
const cxReference=referenceCard;
referenceCard=function(l){return cxReference(l)+`<section class="flow-message"><h3>hamzury client desk</h3><p>${l.reviewDue?'recommendation expected: '+displayDate(l.reviewDue):'your coordinator will confirm the recommendation date here.'}</p>${button('review or correct my answers','form/'+l.scenario+'/'+l.id,'ghost')}</section>`};
const cxOverview=clientOverview;
clientOverview=function(l){return cxOverview(l)+`<form class="card" onsubmit="saveCxDeadline(event,'${l.id}')"><h3>review handoff</h3><label>recommendation expected by</label><input type="datetime-local" name="due" required><div class="actions"><button>save review deadline</button></div></form>`};
function saveCxDeadline(e,id){e.preventDefault();let l=lead(id);l.reviewDue=new Date(new FormData(e.target).get('due')).toISOString();event(l,'review deadline confirmed');render()}
const cxQueue=queueView;
queueView=function(){let stale=db.leads.filter(inScope).filter(l=>l.paid&&l.stage!=='delivered'&&Date.now()-new Date(l.updates?.[0]?.at||l.payment?.at||l.created).getTime()>48*3600000);return cxQueue()+`<section class="card"><h2>48-hour client updates due</h2><p class="small">calendar hours since the latest published update, or activation if no update exists.</p>${stale.map(l=>`<div class="row"><div><b>${E(l.name)}</b><p class="small">${E(l.id)} · owner: ${E(l.owner||'client desk')}</p></div>${button('publish update','lead/'+l.id+'/support','secondary')}</div>`).join('')||'<p>no overdue updates in this view.</p>'}</section>`};
const cxFinalRender=render;
render=function(){let key=(location.hash.split('/')[1]||'');if(location.hash.startsWith('#client/')&&key!==window.cxLastClient){window.cxLastClient=key;let l=lead(key);packageLevel=Number(l?.recommendedLevel??flowItems(l||{}).reduce((n,s)=>Math.min(n,Number(s.level)),3));if(!Number.isFinite(packageLevel))packageLevel=0}cxFinalRender()};
render();

proposalPreviewBody=function(p){return `<section><h3>your situation</h3><p>${E(p.understood)}</p></section><section><h3>your first priority</h3><p>${E(p.priority)}</p></section><section><h3>our recommendation</h3><p>${E(p.recommendation)}</p></section><section class="flow-next"><span>your choice</span><strong>${E(p.next)}</strong></section>`};
const cxFeedback=feedback;
feedback=function(e,id){let text=new FormData(e.target).get('message');cxFeedback(e,id);let l=lead(id),message={message:text};let es=db.escalations||[];if(!es.some(x=>x.clientId===id&&x.issue===message?.message)){es.unshift({id:uid('support'),clientId:id,issue:message?.message||'client message received; review the client feedback record',owner:'client desk',priority:'normal',status:'open',at:now(),due:new Date(Date.now()+48*3600000).toISOString()});db.escalations=es;save()}render()};
render();
const cxOrder=orderProgress;
orderProgress=function(l){let html=cxOrder(l),work=paidWork(l),next=work.find(w=>w.status!=='delivered');if(next){html=html.replace('<section class="flow-deliveries">',`<section class="flow-message"><h2>next milestone</h2><p>${E(next.milestone||next.title)}</p><p class="small">expected ${next.due?displayDate(next.due):'schedule being confirmed'} · responsible team: ${E(next.owner||next.venture)}</p></section><section class="flow-deliveries">`)}work.forEach(w=>{if(w.delayReason)html=html.replace(`<h3>${E(w.title)}</h3>`,`<h3>${E(w.title)}</h3><div class="flow-notice danger"><b>schedule update</b><p>${E(w.delayReason)}</p><p>recovery action: ${E(w.recovery||'your coordinator will confirm the next action.')}</p></div>`)});return html};
const cxMilestoneOverview=clientOverview;
clientOverview=function(l){return cxMilestoneOverview(l)+l.work.map(w=>`<form class="card" onsubmit="saveCxMilestone(event,'${l.id}','${w.id}')"><h3>${E(w.title)} / next milestone</h3><label>next milestone</label><input name="milestone" value="${E(w.milestone||'')}"><label>expected or revised delivery</label><input type="datetime-local" name="due"><label>delay explanation, if applicable</label><textarea name="delayReason">${E(w.delayReason||'')}</textarea><label>recovery action</label><input name="recovery" value="${E(w.recovery||'')}"><button>save delivery handoff</button></form>`).join('')};
function saveCxMilestone(e,id,wid){e.preventDefault();let l=lead(id),w=l.work.find(w=>w.id===wid),d=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));if(d.due){w.previousDue=w.due;w.due=new Date(d.due).toISOString()}delete d.due;Object.assign(w,d);event(l,'delivery milestone updated: '+w.title);render()}
render();
